Weather data: Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), open data under the German
GeoNutzungsverordnung (GeoNutzV). Attribution: "Datenbasis: Deutscher
Wetterdienst". The MOSMIX forecasts, the hourly observations, the warnings,
the pollen and UV indices and the radar composite are published unchanged
or converted in units; the warning titles are translated by this
integration.

